ecution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"722c6bfd-04b9-4ee4-a431-63c6e44acdba"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\n任务切分：\n- 请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。\n任务规划：\n1. 加载指定时间范围内的监控视频流或静态画面，执行图像去噪、画质增强与ROI区域划分，解析分辨率、帧率及拍摄视角等元数据，输出结构化待检图像数据块。\n2. 调用安防场景目标检测模型，对预处理画面中的车辆、人员、路障进行并行识别，记录各类目标的边界框坐标、类别置信度得分及初始空间分布特征，输出带标注的目标属性列表。\n3. 基于目标坐标计算车与人的空间欧氏距离及方位角，结合人体姿态估计与手部动作识别算法，比对预设的距离阈值与搬运姿态特征库，输出空间关联匹配结果及行为意图判定标签。\n4. 将独立检测置信度、空间拓扑关系与行为识别结果输入交叉研判模块，过滤误报与遮挡干扰，按标准模板整合判定依据、证据截图位置及逻辑链条，生成包含组合事件确认结论的可回溯分析报告。\n场景任务：\n- video_surveillance: 我将判断监控画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件。；参数：{'视频对象': '画面', '监控目标': '一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件'}\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '画面', '监控目标': '一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"9fd814d5-bf21-4f58-9d6d-d515935a7887"},{"content":"我来帮您分析监控画面中的目标组合事件。首先需要确认视频源文件的位置。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":154,"prompt_tokens":10948,"total_tokens":11102,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":71,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":154},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10948}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-12549021-1230-9c0e-b760-1f1c582277ba","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8f6a-6731-72a3-a581-7c71baca5027-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"ls -la /mnt/user-data/uploads/ 2>/dev/null | head -30","description":"检查用户上传目录中的视频文件"},"id":"call_07355ecf13c14953b0e0934d","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10948,"output_tokens":154,"total_tokens":11102,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":71}}}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。","normalized_query":"请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将判断监控画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"画面","监控目标":"一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_33624c","text":"请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_8fd8eb","text":"加载指定时间范围内的监控视频流或静态画面，执行图像去噪、画质增强与ROI区域划分，解析分辨率、帧率及拍摄视角等元数据，输出结构化待检图像数据块。"},{"task_span_id":"span_366cb2","text":"调用安防场景目标检测模型，对预处理画面中的车辆、人员、路障进行并行识别，记录各类目标的边界框坐标、类别置信度得分及初始空间分布特征，输出带标注的目标属性列表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_93e826","text":"基于目标坐标计算车与人的空间欧氏距离及方位角，结合人体姿态估计与手部动作识别算法，比对预设的距离阈值与搬运姿态特征库，输出空间关联匹配结果及行为意图判定标签。"},{"task_span_id":"span_edeb87","text":"将独立检测置信度、空间拓扑关系与行为识别结果输入交叉研判模块，过滤误报与遮挡干扰，按标准模板整合判定依据、证据截图位置及逻辑链条，生成包含组合事件确认结论的可回溯分析报告。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_11215f","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将判断监控画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件。","params":{"视频对象":"画面","监控目标":"一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_11215f","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将判断监控画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件。","params":{"视频对象":"画面","监控目标":"一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:d09c44cc-eb3a-4f30-8a83-9dbc410d34c0"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":false,"primary_goal":"请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":[],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":0.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":[],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:d09c44cc-eb3a-4f30-8a83-9dbc410d34c0"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"d09c44cc-eb3a-4f30-8a83-9dbc410d34c0"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): video_surveillance. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"722c6bfd-04b9-4ee4-a431-63c6e44acdba"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\n任务切分：\n- 请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。\n任务规划：\n1. 加载指定时间范围内的监控视频流或静态画面，执行图像去噪、画质增强与ROI区域划分，解析分辨率、帧率及拍摄视角等元数据，输出结构化待检图像数据块。\n2. 调用安防场景目标检测模型，对预处理画面中的车辆、人员、路障进行并行识别，记录各类目标的边界框坐标、类别置信度得分及初始空间分布特征，输出带标注的目标属性列表。\n3. 基于目标坐标计算车与人的空间欧氏距离及方位角，结合人体姿态估计与手部动作识别算法，比对预设的距离阈值与搬运姿态特征库，输出空间关联匹配结果及行为意图判定标签。\n4. 将独立检测置信度、空间拓扑关系与行为识别结果输入交叉研判模块，过滤误报与遮挡干扰，按标准模板整合判定依据、证据截图位置及逻辑链条，生成包含组合事件确认结论的可回溯分析报告。\n场景任务：\n- video_surveillance: 我将判断监控画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件。；参数：{'视频对象': '画面', '监控目标': '一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件'}\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '画面', '监控目标': '一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"9fd814d5-bf21-4f58-9d6d-d515935a7887"},{"content":"我来帮您分析监控画面中的目标组合事件。首先需要确认视频源文件的位置。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":154,"prompt_tokens":10948,"total_tokens":11102,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":71,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":154},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10948}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-12549021-1230-9c0e-b760-1f1c582277ba","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8f6a-6731-72a3-a581-7c71baca5027-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"ls -la /mnt/user-data/uploads/ 2>/dev/null | head -30","description":"检查用户上传目录中的视频文件"},"id":"call_07355ecf13c14953b0e0934d","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10948,"output_tokens":154,"total_tokens":11102,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":71}}},{"content":"total 8\ndrwxrwxrwx 2 root root 4096 Jul 23 22:39 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 root root 4096 Jul 23 22:39 ..","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"7014630d-5d50-4dea-b481-20b07e9eaaf0","tool_call_id":"call_07355ecf13c14953b0e0934d","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/6eb1d284-83c4-4d22-8a57-ba9b6ae371fd/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/6eb1d284-83c4-4d22-8a57-ba9b6ae371fd/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/6eb1d284-83c4-4d22-8a57-ba9b6ae371fd/user-data/outputs"},"title":"组合事件判定","artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[{"content":"请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"d09c44cc-eb3a-4f30-8a83-9dbc410d34c0"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): video_surveillance. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"722c6bfd-04b9-4ee4-a431-63c6e44acdba"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\n任务切分：\n- 请判断画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成“人员在车旁搬运物品”的组合事件。\n任务规划：\n1. 加载指定时间范围内的监控视频流或静态画面，执行图像去噪、画质增强与ROI区域划分，解析分辨率、帧率及拍摄视角等元数据，输出结构化待检图像数据块。\n2. 调用安防场景目标检测模型，对预处理画面中的车辆、人员、路障进行并行识别，记录各类目标的边界框坐标、类别置信度得分及初始空间分布特征，输出带标注的目标属性列表。\n3. 基于目标坐标计算车与人的空间欧氏距离及方位角，结合人体姿态估计与手部动作识别算法，比对预设的距离阈值与搬运姿态特征库，输出空间关联匹配结果及行为意图判定标签。\n4. 将独立检测置信度、空间拓扑关系与行为识别结果输入交叉研判模块，过滤误报与遮挡干扰，按标准模板整合判定依据、证据截图位置及逻辑链条，生成包含组合事件确认结论的可回溯分析报告。\n场景任务：\n- video_surveillance: 我将判断监控画面中是否同时出现一辆车、一个人和一个路障，并分析它们是否构成人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件。；参数：{'视频对象': '画面', '监控目标': '一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件'}\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '画面', '监控目标': '一辆车、一个人、一个路障、人员在车旁搬运物品的组合事件'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"9fd814d5-bf21-4f58-9d6d-d515935a7887"},{"content":"我来帮您分析监控画